2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT The Grand Duchy of Mecklenburg-Schwerin was a territory in Northern Germany held by the House of Mecklenburg residing at Schwerin. It was a sovereign member state of the German Confederation and became a federated state of the Nor
2 CONC th German Confederation and finally of the German Empire in 1871.
