1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The 16th century Polish Nobility
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.almanachdegotha.org/id221.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Consort	Jan Krzysztof Tarnowski; Jan Kostka; Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT with Jan Kostka; Jan Kostka; Anna Magdalena Kostka; Anna Zofia Kostka; Katarzyna Sieniawska; Noble family	House of Odrowąż; Father	Stanisław Odrowąż; Mother	Anna of Masovia; Born	1537; Jarosław Died	July 9, 1580; Jarosław
2 CONT
2 CONT Zofia Odrowąż (1537–1580) was a Polish noble lady.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of castellan and voivode Stanisław Odrowąż and Anna of Masovia from the Piast dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Hetman Jan Krzysztof Tarnowski in 1555 and castellan and voivode Jan Kostka in 1569.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zofia_Odrow%C4%85%C5%BC
