2 CONT
2 CONT Coat of arms	Nałęcz; Wife	Jadwiga Iwańska z Tomic; Elżbieta Zborowska; Katarzyna Leszczyńska; Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Kazimierz Franciszek Czarnkowski; Teresa Konstancja Czarnkowska; Noble family	Czarnkowski; Father	Wojciech Sędziwój Czarnkowski; Mother	Jadwiga Sierpska z Gulczewa; Born	1555; Died	1628; Kalisz
2 CONT
2 CONT Adam Sędziwój Czarnkowski, of the Nałęcz coat-of-arms (1555-1628) was a Polish nobleman (szlachcic).
2 CONT
2 CONT Adam was voivode of Łęczyca Voivodeship, participant of King Stefan Batory`s wars against Muscovy, member of the Sejm, general starost of Greater Poland from 1593 to 1628. He serves as mediator during the Rokosz of Sandomierz. In 
2 CONC 1606-1609 he participated in wars against Turkey and Sweden.
2 CONT
