1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jan Opaliński''' herbu Łodzia (1581-1637) - wojewoda kaliski i poznański. [https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jan_Opali%C5%84ski  Wikipedia PL]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT The 16th century Polish Nobility
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.almanachdegotha.org/id221.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Jan Opaliński (1581–1637) of Łodzia Coat of Arms, son of Jan Opaliński (1546–1598) and Barbara z Ostroroga Lwowska, brother of Piotr Opaliński, was the head of Opaliński family in the 17th century. Voivode of Poznań since 1628, ca
2 CONC stellan of Kalisz since 1624, starost of Inowrocław, pious Catholic and supporter of Society of Jesus, he gathered much wealth.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jan_Opali%C5%84ski_(1581%E2%80%931637)
