2 CONT Kolberg, with most of Farther Pomerania, was granted to Brandenburg-Prussia in 1648 by the Treaty of Westphalia and, after the signing of the Treaty of Stettin (1653), and in accordance with the Treaty of Grimnitz, was part of the
2 CONC  Province of Pomerania. It became part of the Kingdom of Prussia in 1701.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothea Glasenapp, 20.3.1701 geboren  in Landau bei bei Danzig  (Ledovo, Gdansk) und ibidem gestorben 18.1.1776, Tochter von Wilhelm Glasenapp (geboren 1679) und Maria Nickel (1673 - 1734), ist möglich die Kusine, Schwester oder 
2 CONC Halbschwester von Joachim Egert (van) Glasenap. 
