2 CONT Gerhard IV Count Of HOLSTEIN     
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard IV Count Of was born about 1277 in Of, Plon, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  Gerhard IV Count Of's father was Gerhard II Count Of HOLSTEIN and his mother was Ingeborg VALDEMARSDOTTER (FOLKUNGA) PRINCES OF SWEDEN.  His patern
2 CONC al grandparents were Gerhard I Count Of HOLSTEIN and Elisabeth Princess Of MECKLENBURG. He had a brother and a sister, named Waldemar Count Of and Elisabeth (Katharine) Countess Of.  He was the second oldest of the three children.
2 CONC   He died about 1323.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard V Count Of HOLSTEIN & Anastasie Countess Of SCHWERIN-WITTENBERG     
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard IV Count Of and Anastasie Countess Of were married in a religious ceremony on July 30th, 1313.  They had a son and a daughter, named Gerhard V, Count Of and Ingeburg Countess Of.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Gerhard V, Count Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard V, Count Of was born in 1315 in Of, Segeberg, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  He died at the age of 35 in 1350.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Ingeburg Countess Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeburg Countess Of was born about 1316 in Of, , Oldenburg, Germany.  She died before 1340.
