2 CONT Cavalry leader at the Vienna siege.
2 CONT Grandfather of King Stanislaw I Leszczynski. 
2 CONT Great-grandfather of Queen Maria Leszczynska of France, wife of Louis XV.
2 CONT Charles was the godfather to Sobieski's III younger daughter.
2 CONT
